      "message": "Dumping state things in bugreports sounds useful, but I\u0027m not sure how well that corresponds to how the `vm` tool uses this. I also don\u0027t see any documentation of how I should go about using or implementing the dump function. Is there some documentation or at least an example somewhere? In any case, let\u0027s discuss it somewhere other than this change because it\u0027s a separate issue.",
