      "writtenOn": "2021-04-06T17:36:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm... I wonder if it could be necessary (or not) to join the thread.  If we need to guarantee the client to call back, a join would probably be needed in the situation when the main thread is existing before the callback is called.  Although this is service and isn\u0027t expected to quit.  WDYT?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 86,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "b8f1e9608fa330e3f466ef0d6459d03b6d4de676",
