      "writtenOn": "2021-04-13T16:05:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m still not clear on what you expect joining on the threads to achieve. The main thread should never finish unless there is a crash, in which case we want all these monitoring threads to be killed anyway, and Binder death notifications will be sent.\n\nThe monitoring thread will exit after the crosvm instance exits and it has called the callbacks. There isn\u0027t anything else the main thread needs to do in response to that.",
      "parentUuid": "4c627e0b_b2885c06",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
